A note on the ATT&CK disclaimer
-------------------------------
MITRE's statement that ATT&CK does not enumerate every technique, and that covering it does
not guarantee defensive coverage, is not boilerplate here. This server reports what MITRE
publishes and nothing about any particular environment. 549 of 918 techniques have no
D3FEND countermeasure mapped, and mobile has none at all. Absence of an entry is absence of
a mapping, not evidence that a behaviour is safe or undefendable. SKILLS.md carries the
same warning for agents consuming these tools.
